<StoryLayout title="PainByte" year={2016}>
  <p>PainByte</p>
      <p>A new datadrivendance about chronic pain and biomedical engineering.  What does it means to suffer chronic pain on a daily basis.  The invisible nature of the condition.   The developments in treatments that offer a opiate free pain relief system.  We have recently been award a Grants for the Arts Award, Arts Council England to bring this project of life.  In addition to the live ballet we will be creating a VR experience to accompany the ballet.</p>
